<title>USA: FMC Corp Q4 oper earnings up.</title>
<headline>FMC Corp Q4 oper earnings up.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $1.17		    $0.66</p>
<p> Oper net		  44,600		   25,100</p>
<p> Revs		   1,407,600		1,201,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  38,100		   37,900</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1995 excludes $3.3 million, or $0.09 a share, in income from discontinued operations.  </p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper share		 $5.73		    $5.68</p>
<p> Oper net		 218,100		  214,000</p>
<p> Revs		   5,080,600		4,507,700</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  38,100		   37,700</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full 1996 excludes loss of $7.4 million, or $0.19 a share, from discontinued operations. Full 1995 excludes loss of $1.9 million, or $0.05 a share, from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
